{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2021-04-19 09:00:00', 'title': 'AEP ENERGY TO PROVIDE 100% CLEAN ENERGY TO CROWN BATTERY', 'text': "COLUMBUS, OHIO, APRIL 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AEP ENERGY, A SUBSIDIARY OF AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER (NASDAQ: AEP), HAS SIGNED AN AGREEMENT WITH THE FREMONT, OHIO-BASED CROWN BATTERY MANUFACTURING COMPANY TO PROVIDE CLEAN ENERGY THROUGH THE COMPANY'S INTEGRATED RENEWABLE ENERGY (IRE) SOLUTION. AEP ENERGY WILL SUPPLY THE COMPANY WITH CLEAN ENERGY THROUGH IRE – A LONG-TERM, FIXED PRICE RETAIL ENERGY OPTION THAT SUPPORTS NEW, LOCALLY-SOURCED WIND AND SOLAR – FOR MORE THAN 12 YEARS BEGINNING IN JANUARY 2023."}